#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:29
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:31
msgid ""
"Install from the Nextcloud Office package repository, so that updates arrive"
" with regular system updates."
msgstr "請從 Nextcloud Office 軟體庫進行安裝，如此一來，更新將隨定期的系統更新一併推送。"

#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:34
msgid "Debian and Ubuntu"
msgstr "Debian 與 Ubuntu"

#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:42
msgid ""
"The installation also offers the Microsoft core fonts, which improve how "
"documents created in Microsoft Office are displayed. To install them, accept"
" their license when prompted."
msgstr ""
"此安裝程式亦提供 Microsoft 核心字型，可改善在 Microsoft Office "
"中建立的文件顯示效果。若要安裝這些字型，請在系統提示時接受其授權條款。"

#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:46
msgid "Fedora and RHEL"
msgstr "Fedora 與 RHEL"

#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:61
msgid ""
"During the first installation, ``dnf`` asks you to confirm the repository "
"signing key. Check that its fingerprint is ``C013 F0BE F968 00BB BC4D 93DD "
"E6E7 0E5F A287 C3D0`` before you accept it."
msgstr ""
"首次安裝時，``dnf`` 會要求您確認軟體庫的簽章金鑰。在接受之前，請確認其指紋為 ``C013 F0BE F968 00BB BC4D 93DD "
"E6E7 0E5F A287 C3D0``。"

#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:65
msgid "Portable archive"
msgstr "可攜式封存檔"

#: ../../office_desktop_editors.rst:67
msgid ""
"On other distributions, use the portable archive. It is not updated "
"automatically."
msgstr "其他散佈版，則請使用可攜式封存檔。其不會自動更新。"

